    {
      "textRaw": "Cvt - 单位转换",
      "name": "cvt_-_单位转换",
      "desc": "<p><code>cvt</code> 模块用于数据单位转换. 当前公开实现以字节单位转换为主.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>源码依据: <code>runtime/api/augment/converter/Converter.kt</code>, <code>runtime/api/augment/converter/Bytes.kt</code>, <code>runtime/api/augment/converter/core/Bytes.kt</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">cvt</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] bytes",
          "name": "[m]_bytes",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "bytes(source, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "bytes",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>source</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 数值或带单位字符串</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> {{<ul>\n<li><strong>fromUnit</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 来源单位</li>\n<li><strong>toUnit</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 目标单位, 默认 <code>AUTO</code></li>\n<li><strong>fractionDigits</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 小数位数, 默认 <code>2</code></li>\n<li><strong>autoCarryThreshold</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 自动进位阈值, 仅 <code>toUnit</code> 为 <code>AUTO</code> 时允许</li>\n<li><strong>strict</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否使用严格单位模式</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>}}</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/api/java/math/BigDecimal.html\">java.math.BigDecimal</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将字节数据转换为目标单位的数值.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">console.log(cvt.bytes(1024, &#39;KB&#39;)); // 1\nconsole.log(cvt.bytes(&#39;1 MB&#39;, &#39;KB&#39;)); // 1024\nconsole.log(cvt.bytes(1536, { toUnit: &#39;KB&#39;, fractionDigits: 1 })); // 1.5\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "source"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "bytes(source, toUnit, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "bytes",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>source</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>toUnit</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/api/java/math/BigDecimal.html\">java.math.BigDecimal</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
