      ],
      "properties": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] bytes.strict",
          "name": "strict",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "bytes.strict(source, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "strict",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<p>严格模式转换. 严格模式区分 SI 与 IEC 单位:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>KB</code> / <code>MB</code> / <code>GB</code> 等使用 <code>1000</code> 进位.</li>\n<li><code>KiB</code> / <code>MiB</code> / <code>GiB</code> 等使用 <code>1024</code> 进位.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在严格模式中, <code>options.strict</code> 必须为空.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">console.log(cvt.bytes.strict(1000, &#39;KB&#39;)); // 1\nconsole.log(cvt.bytes.strict(1024, &#39;KiB&#39;)); // 1\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "source"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] bytes.loose",
          "name": "loose",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "bytes.loose(source, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "loose",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<p>宽松模式转换. 宽松模式会将 <code>KiB</code> 等 IEC 标识折算为普通单位文本, 并以 <code>1024</code> 为换算基数. 在宽松模式中, <code>options.strict</code> 必须为空.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "source"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] bytes.UNITS",
          "name": "UNITS",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[[ <code>&quot;KMGTPEZYRQ&quot;</code> ]] { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>支持的单位前缀, 依次表示 K/M/G/T/P/E/Z/Y/R/Q.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] bytes.AUTO",
          "name": "AUTO",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[[ <code>&quot;AUTO&quot;</code> ]] { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>自动选择目标单位.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] bytes.IEC_DIV",
          "name": "IEC_DIV",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[[ <code>1024</code> ]] { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p] bytes.SI_DIV",
          "name": "SI_DIV",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[[ <code>1000</code> ]] { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n"
        }
      ],
